Z||000000||FIEROCIOUS||10-21-2000||04:16 PM||||Can a T-5 tranny for a Nissan be compatable with A clutch and bellhouseing for a Small Block Chevy or Ford?<P>Things to consider:<BR>Input shaft tooth and size<BR>bellhouseing to trany bolt pattern<BR>clutch linkage<BR>pressure plate throwout bearing and clutch clearance<P>Clues:<BR>Borg Warner<BR>Toploader<P>Well do you have what it takes?<P>If that one is too hard; <BR>What temperature water thermostat does a "65" VW bug come stock with?<P>||||reg||6
